      ],
      "source": "https://hendersoncountyhomes.com/2025/12/26/the-rich-history-and-modern-charm-of-east-flat-rock/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A railroad once cut through East Flat Rock from Zirconia to Hendersonville, and the 1908 post office opened right across the depot.",
