      "source": "https://www.flatrocktogether.com/good-news/east-flat-rock"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "East Flat Rock sits in southeastern Henderson County, bordered by Flat Rock to the west and unincorporated Barker Heights to the northwest.",
